OL,5,G1300 Couples Come Dine with Me
OL,6,     FIn Cardiff, newly-weds Laura and
OL,7,     FSean host a Hawaiian feast
OL,8,     Ffeaturing fruity surprises. Keith
OL,9,     Fand Lesley-Ann prepare some posh
OL,10,     Fnosh. And Rachel and Lee's lamb
OL,11,     Fcurry proves controversial.
OL,12,G1400 Couples Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FIn Cardiff, first-timers Abi and
OL,14,     FJake plan an American menu, while
OL,15,     Fvegans Ashleigh and Jack serve
OL,16,     Fplant-based fare. But can seasoned
OL,17,     Fhosts Karen and James show the
OL,18,     Fyoungsters how it's done?
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG4/10
